Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(艾利法斯)发动等级·支配的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷·胜利的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降7000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)怎 怎么会…攻击力变成零了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！以太·马赫斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔…！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(虹栗子球)栗栗～
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动手牌中虹栗子球的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.79,0:00:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以变成
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击过来的对方怪兽超量素材的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被装备的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将虹栗子球装备到以太·马赫斯上！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是稍微延缓了终结之时吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.19,0:00:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于战斗结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:52.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇·霍普的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复原状！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.59,0:00:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，由于以太·马赫斯的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变回原本的超量单元。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《虽然不甘心但正如那家伙所说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《星光体……》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不吃的话可撑不住啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名字是？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伊莉丝。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)璃绪……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这孩子是你引见来的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.97,0:02:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔在前方的山谷布下了阵势。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是发动最终决战的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伟大的王啊。无论您做出何种决断，我们都遵从。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的性命……献给您，王。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也献上！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也献上！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总攻击等我发信号。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:02:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(众人)是！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在犹豫吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔必须打倒……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.39,0:03:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 现在战斗的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.37,0:03:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴也会出现大量牺牲。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我一个人来…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凌牙：因为我参加战斗同伴们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不… 世界被卷入战斗不断受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)凌牙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)璃绪…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)这就是 凌牙和我的另一段过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个世界里 我成为了守护哥哥的精灵。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直 一起注视着。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥的人生…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥一直 在烦恼着…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:03:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 该怎么做才好？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙的决断里总是带着温柔。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.42,0:04:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 他总是痛苦着。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}憎恨 只会孕育憎恨。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾经有人这样告诉过我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是游马吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里发生的事的确 是我的记忆！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正如多鲁贝所说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们拥有 两段人生。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.18,0:04:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)哥哥是被选中的人哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥是决定这个世界命运的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在应该去注视那份命运了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我无论何时都会在哥哥身边。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.79,0:04:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《但是啊 璃绪。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果这就是我的命运{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要用我自己的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去反抗》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？纳修的身影不见了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！王的坐骑也不见踪影。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道他一个人去贝库塔那里了……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和深渊决斗过的迷宫！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.60,0:05:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你 竟然到这种地步还有这般因缘啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！没必要再把更多人类
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.37,0:05:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卷进来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你 单挑决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场胜负 我接下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}欢迎啊，纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然能一个人走到这里来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.15,0:06:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，既然我接受了你的提议{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对决方式就由我来决定吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负就用暗之游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗怪兽来分！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.69,0:08:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此，这块石板就是卡牌吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢向我挑战决斗，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会让你后悔的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.39,0:08:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先手归我了！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 哥尔贡尼克·古尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将另一只哥尔贡尼克·古尔\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.45,0:09:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有哥尔贡尼克·古尔时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.35,0:09:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付300生命值就能特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 第3只\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥尔贡尼克·古尔{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现状脱皮！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有 相同等级的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3只时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从对方卡组中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将和那只怪兽相同等级的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到我的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从我的卡组？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选的是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将美人鱼·鲨鱼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到我的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《王！王！》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)我盖上两张石板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.39,0:10:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为一口气把怪兽展开就行了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西 我一下就给你扫光！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 尖刺鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.32,0:10:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将寂静{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鮟鱇\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鮟鱇{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有水属性怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将另一只寂静{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鮟鱇➡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！尖刺鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中计了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续陷阱卡 哥尔贡尼克·诱惑！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上存在冠有哥尔贡尼克之名的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.81,0:10:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以改变对方的攻击对象！我将攻击对象
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变更为美人鱼·鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:10:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种陷阱毫无意义！尖刺·鲨鱼的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力更高！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你根本不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗之决斗的意义啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拯救王！全军突击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全面战争开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我应该说过吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是一场暗之游戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.48,0:11:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗也将决定那些家伙的命运！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:44.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}扣下那个扳机的人是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是这种程度的痛苦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本比不上你内心的痛苦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要把其他人卷进我们的战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为那就是你的弱点啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.61,0:12:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿在你心中的温柔与正义，正是你的弱点！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想好好欣赏你痛苦挣扎的样子啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.09,0:12:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.96,0:12:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在此刻 陷阱发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.61,0:12:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阴谋的大灾难！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你那里夺来的怪兽在战斗中被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.63,0:12:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就能获得1000点以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.01,0:12:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到伤害的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你持有的所有石板中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比被破坏的怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更强的怪兽破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我卡组里的怪兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.71,0:13:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张石板，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是正戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤戈尔贡尼克·地狱犬！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动戈尔贡尼克·地狱犬的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.07,0:13:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈尔贡尼克·地狱犬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤成功的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己怪兽的等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变成3！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级3的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈尔贡尼克·地狱犬和食尸鬼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 高耳巨兽·守护者！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再用剩下的2只
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高耳巨兽·食尸鬼进行超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:13:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一只高耳巨兽·守护者！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要慢慢折磨你！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用高耳巨兽·守护者直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.41,0:14:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再吃一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.85,0:14:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}射击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你和你军队马上就要全军覆没了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算肉体毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}献给神的灵魂也会复苏！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.69,0:15:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把墓地里的『潜鲨』的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙在墓地里的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以作为超量召唤的素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级5的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两只『潜鲨』进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地超量召唤！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.73！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神啊，降临吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激泷神 深渊溅跃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这种局面下还能召唤神！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动深渊溅跃的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗期间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成两倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！深渊溅跃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.36,0:15:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}黄金卿·守护者的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.08,0:16:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的1只怪兽的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想逃吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 超量楔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.54,0:16:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用超量单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动效果时将其效果无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 这个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上 等级最高的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量体以外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用超量单元的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你输了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 深渊·飞溅！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击戈尔贡守护者！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最终陷落！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.89,0:16:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是你也把那命运{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好烙印在眼中吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.30,0:16:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伊莉丝… 伊莉丝～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 没能{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.57,0:17:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护住你。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.95,0:17:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不对。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我夺走的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪 还有同伴 大家的性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)众人的灵魂逝去。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前往巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪… 多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 我想起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是 我真正的人生。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也想起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我真正的记忆。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 我明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你会作为异晶界的领袖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}苏醒过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德鲁贝）原本很小的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被卷入你和贝库塔的战斗中的灵魂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使其成长了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我… 让异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:18:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是 异晶界人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然有如此讽刺的命运？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 星光… 快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.02,0:19:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙本该战斗的真正的对手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然是我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这场决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不能输绝不能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和星光体一起构筑的卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会回应我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧比塔尔7)能量等级 急速上升。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.56,0:19:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)异世界的某处{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法估量的能量正在被释放出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？难道是游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)不妙啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，这个装置还能撑多久…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.23,0:19:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.72,0:20:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量宝藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以按照场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1只超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 我要抽两张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《阿斯特拉尔…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会把你从那里救出来的》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.51,0:20:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 命运的抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来了 我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法卡发动！ 星辉·强袭！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 在这个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己1只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能对对手进行直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽之间不进行战斗的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级·支配的效果就不会发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的生命值是1200。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.49,0:20:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇·霍普进行直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那攻击 可不能让你通过！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 阶级·墙壁！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.71,0:21:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 是当我方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只超量怪兽的阶级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比攻击过来的对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级更高时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那次攻击无效并结束战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才的攻击也起不了作用吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放2张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.71,0:21:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 希望皇·霍普的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.39,0:21:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么需要升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你 还没有理解啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是在升级之后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.36,0:21:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都不曾见过的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇迹的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.39,0:21:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我来让你见识一下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那奇迹的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越极限的 化身。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.92,0:21:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级13的怪物EXCEEDS！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.39,0:22:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级13的…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪物EXCEEDS！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.15,0:23:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
